.  Use your fists, various weapons, and even powers in order to defeat the horde.\n\nAs you progress through the levels, receive various upgrades as the enemies get more difficult.\n\n**Intense Melee Combat!**\n\n{1773219323840210}\n\n**Cause Chaos!**\n\nCause extreme carnage and chaos through your violence!\n\n{978583751643286}\n\n**Use Powers!**\n\nLeverage the use of more than four different powers to defeat your foes!\n\n{2061456481460783}\n\n**More than 10 weapons!**\n\nTake advantage of more than 10 different unique weapons to cause the most creative violence.\n\n{1335396602024828}\n\n\n", "short_description": "Take revenge on the horde that conquered your world. Smash enemies with your fists, master devastating powers, and create absolute chaos with a huge arsenal of weapons."}]}, "developer_name": "AP Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/infernal-climb-vr/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AP Publishing", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/infernal-climb-vr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1360704628898901"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/646413489_2031098964959367_9502